(Summary)
This is the adorable moment Memphis Grizzlies player Marc Gasol and a special needs boy shared a quick chat and a high-five after a game. Gasol was walking back to the locker room after his team won when he stopped to talk with a very enthusiastic young fan on the sidelines. As Gasol walked away the delighted boy clutched his Grizzlies jacket to his chest as the biggest smile spread across his face. The young child is a devoted Grizzlies fan and popular with the players.
